-for-agents/#source-2","@type":"Source","creator":"Garcia-Molina, H.; Salem, K.","date":"1987","dcterms:source":"https://doi.org/10.1145/38713.38742","grade":"secondary","title":"Sagas","verifiedOn":"2026-11-10T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/saga-for-agents/#source-3","@type":"Source","creator":"Fortuna, E.","date":"2023","dcterms:source":"https://temporal.io/blog/saga-pattern-made-easy","grade":"secondary","title":"Saga design pattern explained: Benefits, use cases, and implementation","verifiedOn":"2026-11-12T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/shadow-mode-rollout/","@type":"Concept","altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"observe-only mode"},{"@language":"en","@value":"shadow deployment"},{"@language":"en","@value":"shadow testing (SageMaker)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"shadow variant"}],"created":"2026-08-18T00:00:00Z","definition":{"@language":"en","@value":"Run an agent on live work with its side effects suppressed, then compare its proposed actions with what people actually did."},"inScheme":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/","kind":"pattern","modified":"2026-11-18T00:00:00Z","operator":"human:andreibesleaga","origin":"imported","prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Shadow-Mode Rollout"},"related":["https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/autonomy-ladder/","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/canary-and-shadow-prompts/","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/evolutionary-prompt-search/","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/trajectory-vs-outcome-evals/"],"schema:license":"LicenseRef-AgenticSystemCore-Content-Use-1.0","source":["https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/shadow-mode-rollout/#source-1","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/shadow-mode-rollout/#source-2","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/shadow-mode-rollout/#source-3"],"status":"stable","usageInfo":"LicenseRef-AgenticSystemCore-Content-Use-1.0"},